{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_44_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_44","textTraditional":"一、十有五年，春，齊侯、宋公、陳侯、衞侯、鄭伯會於鄄。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_44_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_44","textTraditional":"復同會也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_44_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_44","textTraditional":"二、夏，夫人姜氏如齊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_44_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_44","textTraditional":"婦人既嫁不踰竟，踰竟非禮也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_44_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_44","textTraditional":"三、秋，宋人、齊人、邾人伐郳。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_44_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_44","textTraditional":"四、鄭人侵宋。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_44_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_44","textTraditional":"五、冬，十月。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}